{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56272","headline":"青城山观 · 晓峦","name":"青城山观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"静见门庭紫气生，前山岚霭入楼青。\n玉坛醮罢鬼神喜，金鼎药成鸡犬灵。\n岩下水光分五色，壶中人寿过千龄。\n何当一日抛凡骨，骑取苍龙上杳冥。\n（《增广圣宋高僧诗选後集》卷中。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"晓峦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56272.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56272","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}